11814 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 24013 0 R/T(In the field of process control modules for the construction of controllers and controlled systems are provided. Where possible, the modules measures the cycle time and calculate the output change with the current cycle time. This process has and advantage to a process over a fixed cycle time, that control systems of different speeds can be processed within the same task. Another advantage is the fact that at low priority Tasks the cycle time can vary and a controller with fixed cycle time inaccurate output values generates. The user should ensure with use of the set, that the cycle time of the task is in accordance with the requirements of the process.)/K[19 11813 0 R]/Pg 25921 0 R>>
endobj
